Krita Nova 51 - shortcuts in the Layers docker's button tooltips

The buttons at the bottom of the Layers docker show their action's keyboard
shortcut in the tooltip, like the toolbox (patch 44): "Add new layer or mask
(Insert)", "Duplicate layer or mask (Ctrl+J)", Clear (patch 43), move down /
up, properties, delete. Several shortcuts are listed with commas; changing a
shortcut updates the tooltip. The Add button shows the shortcut of "Add Paint
Layer", what a click on it does.

LayerBox.cpp: showShortcutInToolTip() for the buttons connected with
connectActionToButton() and SyncButtonAndAction, and for bnAdd.
